    affiliation: "EFREI Research Lab, Paris Panthéon-Assas University"
  - family-names: Loth
    given-names: Alex
    affiliation: "French Tennis Federation"
keywords:
  - tennis analytics
  - self-supervised learning
  - contrastive learning
  - playing style discovery
  - large language models
